# ==============================================================================
# Nivesh Firewall Frontend — Production Environment Configuration Template
# Phase 16.4: Frontend + API Production Deployment
# ==============================================================================
# In production, set this to your authoritative HTTPS backend API domain.
# For same-domain reverse-proxy deployments (e.g. Nginx proxying /api/ to backend),
# leave VITE_API_BASE_URL empty to use relative API requests.
